A dozen vessels transit Hormuz Strait over the weekend






                A total of 12 vessels transited the Strait of Hormuz on Saturday and Sunday, shipping date showed on Monday.&nbsp;

The figure is down from&nbsp;35 during the previous weekend.&nbsp;

Iran's supreme leader hails IRGC in handwritten note, IRNA reports






                Iran’s Supreme Leader, Ayatollah Mojtaba Khamenei, has hailed the Iranian Revolutionary Guard Corps Aerospace Force for its “tireless efforts”, according to the Islamic Republic News Agency (IRNA).&nbsp;

